{"about_the_game":"What does it mean to be? <br>What does &quot;it&quot; mean? <br>Two bees? <br>What? <br><br><strong>Mini Mecum</strong> is a walking simulator about having weird conversations in pretty places. Explore gorgeous hand-crafted environments as you discuss bizarre and existentialist topics with a variety of surreal characters.<br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Four unique environments to explore!<br><br></li><li> Over 1,200 lines of dialogue!<br><br></li><li> Mind-Bending geometry and locales!<br><br></li><li> Existentialist dread regarding the fate of the cosmos and our place within them!<br><br></li><li> An adaptive soundtrack!<br><br></li><li> At least three elevators! (Four, actually)<br><br></li><li> Him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965840/extras/77dd4afd340c0429260ffc27d37a302f.webp?t=1738949263\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965840/extras/77dd4afd340c0429260ffc27d37a302f.poster.avif?t=1738949263\" class=\"bb_img\" width=438 height=1200 /></picture></span></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Developer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1965840/ccb5d8961d5fb180773087946c92b0f1cba7bc18.jpg"},{"name":"Crustacean Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1965840/0ddee41d42bf9f7c8f57483a703e09c9984ce036.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Toll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1965840/d600042b098c6ffed5ff57b3db6e135a3f58b66c.jpg"},{"name":"Well here you go.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1965840/6a4586624000eaa11b1a9272604e9cf95398bc4b.jpg"},{"name":"The End.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1965840/7a8669e77db6238030109749c23b72bf80b07912.jpg"},{"name":"Monkey at a typewrite